Description: AINSS - AI-Native Software Stack (Early Alpha)
 Memory (exomind), scheduler (exosched), orchestrator (exoflow),
 documentation auditor (exodoc), quality system (exoqms), research
 daemon (exocrawl), context continuity (exocontext) and the behavioral
 development kit (exokit) for AI agents. Plain-text, zero-dependency
 daemons: run any module from the console or as an MCP server
 (<module>-server), every module also served at /exo<module> on its port.
